---
description: torrin_core must stay Qt-free; engine thread owns libtorrent
globs: "{src/core/**,include/torrin/**}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# torrin_core boundaries

- Never `#include` Qt headers in `src/core/` or `include/torrin/`.
- All `libtorrent::session` and `torrent_handle` use stays on the worker thread inside `SessionManager`.
- UI and QML communicate via `TorrentCommand` queue and `TorrentSnapshot` value types only.
- Public API lives in `include/torrin/` only.
